  "notes": "<p>This show celebrated Phish Radio on Sirius XM with a large allotment of tickets given to Sirius listeners. Hello My Baby was performed&nbsp;for the first time since June 18, 2009 (417 shows). Jesus Just Left Chicago was played for the first time since October 22, 2014&nbsp;(186 shows). Chalk Dust Torture was unfinished.&nbsp;Weekapaug Groove contained&nbsp;Ass Handed quotes from Trey, Fish, and Page. 2001 contained Skin It Back teases from Mike and Trey and featured Fish on Marimba Lumina</p>",
